FOUR REFUSALS ARE PART OF THE DESIGN, each measured, none hypothetical:
  - getpid/cpu_count/times are NOT env_read rows: env_read auto-derives
    host_secret taint sources, and a pid is not a secret.
  - os.urandom is NOT rowed: an auto-derived source DISPLACES the richer
    hand-written shipped source, tripping the INV-faput caveat on every
    python repo (three rc-0 control fixtures went rc 3 in this run).
  - file.flush is NOT an fs_write row: flush commits writes already counted,
    and the row made cli.py's own stdout flush read as an unwrapped write
    (wrapper-discipline gate).
  - fd PLUMBING (dup, dup2, pipe, openpty) is NOT fs_write: it moves no
    data, and a dup2 row turned cli.py's stdout-shutdown redirect into a
    false unsanitized host_fs finding (same gate).

